+The general lifting step for a prediction or update is:
+$$ y[n] = \lfloor x[n] + c \cdot z[n] \rceil $$
+where $c$ is the filter coefficient (approximated for integer implementation) and $\lfloor \cdot \rceil$ denotes rounding to the nearest integer [S1].
